      "comment": "GOLDSTAR BONES (7) stalked the lead from a middle draw and boxed on well to finish 2.5 lengths back in third (30.44) at this track in a Maiden over 520m. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Expected to feature in the finish again. TIME MATTERS (5) proved too good last time out claiming his maiden success at this track over 520m (29.92). One of the key runners again. SALOON (1) settled back off the inside but went through his gears strongly to find the frame with a 13 length third (30.89) at this track in Maiden. Well-placed to take this out. KYLIE MOLE (3) is worth including after a top-three finish at this track and distance most recently.",
